# Never invent

Do not guess API behavior, config values, DB contents, or teammate intent and then ship code, issue comments, or PRs from that guess.

**Proof:** code on the failing path, runtime/QA, read-only queries, ticket text, or explicit user confirmation.

If unknown, stop, investigate, or ask. Mark uncertainty in chat — not in the tracker as fact.
